    "durationMs": 118121,
    "finalText": "The URL Shortener API is complete and verified. Final state:\n\n**Implementation**\n- `app/` — FastAPI 0.115 app with SQLAlchemy 2.0 (psycopg3) models, Pydantic v2 schemas, and settings read from `DATABASE_URL` (URL normalized to the `postgresql+psycopg://` dialect; no hard-coded credentials)\n- `alembic/` — migration creating the `links` table (unique indexed code, url, clicks, created_at)\n- `start.sh` — runs `alembic upgrade head`, then serves uvicorn in the foreground on `0.0.0.0:8000` (dependencies preinstalled, not installed in the script)\n- `requirements.txt` — pinned preinstalled versions; `README.md` includes the start instructions; `tests/` holds a pytest suite\n\n**Verified behavior**\n- POST `/links`: 201 with `{code, url, clicks: 0}`, URL returned unchanged, generated 8-char codes when omitted, 409 `{\"error\"}` on duplicate custom code\n- GET `/links/{code}` / `/r/{code}`: 200 fetch, 302 with exact Location and exactly one click increment, 404 `{\"error\"}` for unknown codes\n- GET `/links`: ascending creation order with `total`\n- Malformed JSON, missing/invalid url, and invalid code all return 422 `{\"error\": ...}` via custom handlers\n- 7/7 pytest tests pass, all endpoints confirmed over live HTTP, and click counts/data survived a full server restart; DB and caches were cleaned afterward"
  }
